# The #5243 shape: transform remediation of a versioned tree writes each
# rewritten body without its version envelope.
MODULE: DestinationStampedAtTargetTransformDropsStamp
TARGET: DestinationStampedAtTarget
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a transform writes the decoded body with no envelope (#5243)
PERTURBS: BuildStep

--- FIND
          ELSE /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![dest][k] = Rewrite(data[alias][k], mode)]
--- REPLACE
          ELSE /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![dest][k] =
                    IF mode = "Transform"
                    THEN [Rewrite(data[alias][k], mode) EXCEPT !.st = "None"]
                    ELSE Rewrite(data[alias][k], mode)]
--- END
